    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<i><strong>Navigate the Archipelago of Logic</strong></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066440/extras/7de35fea8f6ca6263fe235bb8e600e92.poster.avif?t=1732950462\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066440/extras/7de35fea8f6ca6263fe235bb8e600e92.webm?t=1732950462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066440/extras/7de35fea8f6ca6263fe235bb8e600e92.mp4?t=1732950462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u300cArchipel Logic Infinite\u300d</strong> is an enthralling puzzle game inspired by Nurikabe.<br><br>Uncover ancient archipelagos exposed by drastic drops in sea levels due to tectonic shifts and climate change. Draw the boundaries between land and sea to complete your maps and solve.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>36 Captivating Story-Driven Puzzles</strong><br>Embark on a journey through a main story mode featuring unique themes and engaging narratives that pull you into the world of ancient explorers.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Endlessly AI-Generated Puzzles</strong><br>Keep your mind sharp with puzzles that are infinitely generated by AI, perfectly tuned to match your skill level and keep you constantly challenged.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Innovative Puzzle Mechanics</strong><br>Experience a fresh gameplay dynamic as you reveal land and sea to solve each puzzle, offering a distinctive and rewarding puzzle-solving experience.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Minimalist Graphics and Stunning BGM</strong><br>Enjoy the game\u2019s simple yet elegant graphics paired with a fantastic background music that enhances the immersive atmosphere and keeps you engaged.</li></ul><br>Summon your courage and become a legendary explorer! Follow the whispering waves, trace the paths of ancient navigators, discover new archipelagos, and unveil the secrets of mythical islands. Be the first to chart the legendary archipelago and claim your place in history!",
    "about_the_game": "<i><strong>Navigate the Archipelago of Logic</strong></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066440/extras/7de35fea8f6ca6263fe235bb8e600e92.poster.avif?t=1732950462\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066440/extras/7de35fea8f6ca6263fe235bb8e600e92.webm?t=1732950462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066440/extras/7de35fea8f6ca6263fe235bb8e600e92.mp4?t=1732950462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u300cArchipel Logic Infinite\u300d</strong> is an enthralling puzzle game inspired by Nurikabe.<br><br>Uncover ancient archipelagos exposed by drastic drops in sea levels due to tectonic shifts and climate change. Draw the boundaries between land and sea to complete your maps and solve.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>36 Captivating Story-Driven Puzzles</strong><br>Embark on a journey through a main story mode featuring unique themes and engaging narratives that pull you into the world of ancient explorers.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Endlessly AI-Generated Puzzles</strong><br>Keep your mind sharp with puzzles that are infinitely generated by AI, perfectly tuned to match your skill level and keep you constantly challenged.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Innovative Puzzle Mechanics</strong><br>Experience a fresh gameplay dynamic as you reveal land and sea to solve each puzzle, offering a distinctive and rewarding puzzle-solving experience.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Minimalist Graphics and Stunning BGM</strong><br>Enjoy the game\u2019s simple yet elegant graphics paired with a fantastic background music that enhances the immersive atmosphere and keeps you engaged.</li></ul><br>Summon your courage and become a legendary explorer! Follow the whispering waves, trace the paths of ancient navigators, discover new archipelagos, and unveil the secrets of mythical islands. Be the first to chart the legendary archipelago and claim your place in history!",
    "short_description": "\u300cArchipel Logic Infinite\u300d is a challenging puzzle game inspired by the popular Nurikabe. Explore legendary archipelagos by marking cells as land or sea to unchart maps. Enjoy challenging puzzles and endless procedurally generated content for limitless exploration.",
